Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.58,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}A Danish museum opens a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:04.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}crate. Then another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:06.94,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Imagine being the accountant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:08.11,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}More than half a million
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:09.32,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}kroner is somewhere between
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:11.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}“fragile” and “this side up.”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:12.85,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The museum lent artist
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:15.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Jens Haaning actual banknotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.05,0:00:16.45,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}He was supposed to frame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:17.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}the {\c&H006DDCFF&}cash{\r} to show what
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}a year’s income looked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.41,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}like in Denmark and Austria.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.41,0:00:22.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Then give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.49,0:00:24.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}So far even the accountant
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.01,0:00:26.29,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}gets the fucking metaphor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:28.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Back to the crates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:30.16,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}No banknotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:32.26,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Two {\c&H006DDCFF&}empty{\r} frames.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:33.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}There is a title,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.48,0:00:35.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}though. Take the Money
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.62,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}and Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The man sent in his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:38.66,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}fucking excuse and they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:39.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}had to hang that up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:40.58,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:42.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}And the museum exhibited
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:44.80,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}it. Imagine being the security
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}guard. Your entire job
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:48.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}is making sure nobody takes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:50.46,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}anything. How the fuck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:51.32,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}do you check at the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:53.04,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}end of your shift?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:54.80,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}When the exhibition closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.80,0:00:55.96,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}the museum asked for the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:00:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}{\c&H006DDCFF&}cash{\r} back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:00:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}This is where art and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:00.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}accounting part company.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:01.36,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}In art,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:02.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}an absence can be deeply
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}meaningful. In accounting,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:07.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}it’s a fucking discrepancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:08.56,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}In twenty twenty-three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.56,0:01:09.62,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}a court ordered him to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}pay back nearly half a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:12.20,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}million kroner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.22,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}His {\c&H006DDCFF&}fee{\r} was deducted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Which means he actually
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.70,0:01:17.74,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}got paid for the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:19.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}That’s the bit that kills
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.09,0:01:21.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}me. I’ve been producing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.05,0:01:22.13,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}fuck all at work for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.13,0:01:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}years. Never occurred
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:25.89,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}to me to sign it.
